# The supervisor, RFC 0017's restart policy in ring 3: a console to
# report through, the authority to make one domain at a time, memory
# holding the child's image (sized by the granter to the program it
# stages), and the signal endings arrive on.
package sup
version 0.1.0

program bin/sup
entry hertz
cap endpoint console
cap domain-control
cap memory
cap notification

payload bin/sup from user/sup/target/x86_64-unknown-none/release/sup
